### 1. REGISTER — створити користувача

POST http://localhost:6060/User
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "testuser",
  "password": "test1234"
}


### 2. SECURITY — без авторизації, очікуємо 401

GET http://localhost:6060/api/accounts

### 3. SECURITY — з Basic Auth, очікуємо 200

GET http://localhost:6060/api/accounts
Authorization: Basic testuser test1234

### 4. GET BY ID — отримати конкретний Account

GET http://localhost:6060/api/accounts/1

### 5. UPDATE — оновити існуючий Account

POST http://localhost:6060/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 500,
  "type": "INCOME",
  "account": {
    "id": 1
  },
  "category": "Salary"
}
###
POST http://localhost:6060/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 5000,
  "type": "EXPENSE",
  "account": {
    "id": 1
  },
  "category": "Food"
}
### 5. GET BY ID — перевірити, що UPDATE спрацював

GET http://localhost:6060/api/accounts/1

### 6. DELETE — видалити Account

DELETE http://localhost:6060/api/accounts/1

### 7. GET BY ID — перевірити, що Account видалений

GET http://localhost:6060/api/accounts/1

### 8. GET ALL — перевірити список після DELETE

GET http://localhost:6060/api/accounts

### 9. GET неіснуючого Account

GET http://localhost:6060/api/accounts/9999

### 10. UPDATE неіснуючого Account

PUT http://localhost:6060/api/accounts/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fake Account",
  "balance": 1000.00,
  "currency": "EUR"
}

### 11. DELETE неіснуючого Account

DELETE http://localhost:6060/api/accounts/9999
